  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6ece7837f0e6c14ebcad7cfc05bc72e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Conquest 3v3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: 2
  displayName: Conquest 3v3
  family: 0
  familyName: Conquest
  sizeName: 3v3
  teams: 0000000001000000
  seatsPerTeam: 3
  spectatorSeats: 3
  sceneName: Game Scene
  available: 1
  lobbyModeValue: 2
  infoCards:
  - title: Goal
    text: Be the last team standing. Take the enemy capitals, then finish off their
      players.
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Zones
    text: You can only capture a zone next to one your team holds. Tier 3 zones fall
      fastest. Your capital heals you quickest; Tier 2 zones heal you more slowly.
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Gold and upgrades
    text: Every zone you hold outside your capital pays your whole team gold while
      you keep it. Spend it in the shop inside your own territory when you're out
      of combat, or while you wait to respawn. Hold a zone long enough and it builds
      a bounty; whoever takes it from you collects it. Your first attachment and
      movement ability are free.
    accent: {r: 0.9098039, g: 0.7254902, b: 0.19215687, a: 1}
  - title: Last stand
    text: Lose your capital and your team stops respawning. Win it back, or take
      an enemy capital, before the last of you falls.
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: The map shrinks
    text: When the first team is knocked out, its corner of the map closes and the
      remaining teams fight in a smaller arena.
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Centre scan
    text: The centre sends out a scan on a fixed clock. If your team holds the centre
      when a scan starts, you see every enemy it passes over.
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Two teams
    text: Only two teams play. The third corner of the map is closed from the start.
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
